    "text": "So far, the military members below the grade of O6 are very supportive of Hegseth's reforms. The biggest change needed is the reduction of flag or general officers and reduction of their bloated staffs. Cut down on the number of commands and directorates. That would enable the building of new ships and shipyards with the money we save. Also, the Army has to be reduced so that we can have a better Navy. And we need to dive into robotics, AI and unmanned craft to the maximum extent.",
